inst/extdata/wkssfgeo_cnr_ais.parquet
inst/extdata/wkssfgeo_cnr_dansk_trips.parquet
inst/extdata/wkssfgeo_cnr_dansk_ping_trips.parquet
inst/extdata/wkssfgeo_cnr_med_harbours.parquet
  From R-dev/galdelli_pulcinella_tassetti/data (CNR-IRBIM) of the ICES
  Workshop WKSSFGEO, https://github.com/ices-eg/WKSSFGEO, branch dev_branch,
